      "body": "Post-merge exact-head check at 44608ba2 on RTX 5090 (Claude lab): op suite **31 passed / 0 failed / 1 ignored** (incl. 9 bf16 tests, first run on sm_120); 96M 300-step dialogue-train from chat-100m2-balp-s1, same binary/data/seed: f32 0.0862 s/step vs **bf16 0.0689 s/step (1.25×)**, dev response NLL 0.09071 vs 0.09171 (within noise). Consistent with the frozen 29M gate. Note: this PR was merged before an exact-head review by a second lab was posted; the evidence above is recorded after the fact.",
